%% Student Takes and Submits an Exam
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Student
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as Express API
    participant Auth as Student Authorization
    participant Service as Student Exam Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Student->>UI: Open available exams page
    UI->>API: GET /api/student/exams/available + JWT
    API->>Auth: Verify JWT and STUDENT role
    Auth-->>API: Authorized request
    API->>Service: getAvailableExams(studentId)
    Service->>DB: SELECT published available exams
    DB-->>Service: Available exams
    Service-->>UI: Exams JSON
    UI-->>Student: Display available exams

    Student->>UI: Select Start Exam
    UI->>API: POST /api/student/exams/:examId/start
    API->>Auth: Verify student
    API->>Service: startExam(examId, studentId)
    Service->>DB: Validate exam availability
    Service->>DB: INSERT exam session
    Service->>DB: INSERT IN_PROGRESS submission
    DB-->>Service: Session and submission
    Service-->>UI: Start-exam response

    UI->>API: GET /api/student/exams/:examId
    API->>Service: getStudentSafeExam(examId)
    Service->>DB: SELECT exam questions and options
    DB-->>Service: Exam data
    Service->>Service: Remove correct answers
    Service-->>UI: Student-safe exam JSON
    UI-->>Student: Display exam questions

    loop During the exam
        Student->>UI: Enter or change answer
        UI->>API: PATCH /api/submissions/:id/auto-save
        API->>Auth: Verify student ownership
        API->>Service: autoSaveAnswers(submissionId, answers)
        Service->>DB: INSERT or UPDATE answers
        DB-->>Service: Answers saved
        Service-->>UI: Auto-save success
    end

    Student->>UI: Select Submit Exam
    UI->>API: POST /api/submissions/:id/submit
    API->>Auth: Verify student ownership
    API->>Service: submitExam(submissionId)
    Service->>DB: UPDATE status to SUBMITTED
    Service->>DB: UPDATE session end time
    DB-->>Service: Submitted record
    Service-->>UI: Submission success
    UI-->>Student: Display submission confirmation
